# Looksmax Alt Counter

Shows a small number next to every username on looksmax.org with how many alts the user has.

- **Red number:** the user has at least one active alt
- **Grey number:** only alts that are awaiting approval

Tap a number to see the list of alts.

## Install

1. Install [Tampermonkey](https://www.tampermonkey.net/) in your browser.
2. Open this link and tap **Install**:
   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jm57vnv42c-glitch/Looksmax-alt-counter-by-Atra/main/looksmax-alt-counter.user.js

Updates are installed automatically.

**Note:** Only works for moderators who can see the "Multiple accounts" tab on profiles.

Feedback and bug reports are welcome!
